  - Nothing in the app sets [38;5;153muserId[39m in [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m yet.
  - The server should treat this [38;5;153muserId[39m as unverified, because the browser supplies it and anyone can change it.

  I haven't committed anything. Tell me if you want a commit.

